{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"a84a583b9a58a92e3e54133a62e747f13bd49c32a48b5ed4e81838aff384d8fd","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"cc71bc2cab39763375b1d71b79fca5743ca19d7ecf1e0048e8751826a1c62049","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"cdac06c97945087b597d5db73e5dd09e220ff8e15e1dd6f2818f056edb37a40a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:195-198（Dethblyd 的 desc）。\"subtlety of naming\" 是在调侃这把剑的拙劣命名（Dethblyd≈deathblade），译成「从不擅长谋略」，意思不对。\"the power of his massive sword\" 说的是他那把巨剑的威力，译文改成了「他的力量」，没提剑，把属性说成人的。另有错字：「无以伦比」应为「无与伦比」。"},{"revision_key":"ce3b54895d49edbdf483d73d8901a370ad0c2e32121ab624a1863edd3fc77c8d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:116-122 有几处语义错误：(1) 两处 \"patch him up\"（L116、L122）意思是给他疗伤，译文成了「把他带走」和「带下去」，而后文正写到伤口愈合；(2) \"it missed your eyes\" 指酸液没有溅到眼睛，被译成「他漏看了你的眼睛」；(3) \"Structural damage subpar\" 里的 subpar（低于预期）被漏译，这正是后文说对方失望的原因；(4) \"your skin still bubbles\" 被译成「仍在颤抖」，应为冒泡。"},{"revision_key":"d393910508b1902c2781c49e8ee8d768ad97f0175c50abac7ca64088ebb8b1fe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon-seeds.lua:24-27 显示 Flame Bolts（DEMON_SEED_FIRE_BOLTS）的 range = 5，是远程技能。译名「近战火球」添加了源文和数据定义都没有的「近战」，与 range 相矛盾；bolt 也被改成了 ball。冻结片段里没有看到任何近战机制的依据。"},{"revision_key":"d3c0b76c51ea9a2d4e205eea79d505dacdbee9d022539c42f888731f50ad7d31","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"d3db2e0afe622cb0b7334175689de0ee7503a30077262683d6fc67ec219803b3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"d3e2c5ca56a9bbb2baa5058291cbc6cca9eff5ec8aab802098ee4f80f7652c0f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"d4e9fc7ae6bd54da2ef09fe24d32de59c7df8eb999cbbe270e30de807f665abc","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"timed_effects.lua:577 源文只写 \"On death, the flame will explode.\"，译文却加了「以更弱的强度传播到附近目标身上」这项机制说明。冻结片段只到 L580，BURNING_PLAGUE 的 on_die 实现不在输入范围内，所以无法确认实际是爆炸伤害还是减弱后的传播。证据不足，需要宿主核对 on_die 实现（DLC 来源未固定）。"},{"revision_key":"dac57e56ba34a2eab7c2d776820329f1c6b1c68f55a99aa7a2a3808158734466","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:226-228 有几处与源文不符：(1) \"Highest priority is now isolating <?=player.name?>\" 里的 isolating（隔离）被漏译，句子成了「启动最高优先级措施」；(2) \"Blow all connectors\" 意为炸毁连接，被弱化成「关闭」；(3) \"double-bladed katana\" 漏了「双刃」，\"giant construct\" 漏了「巨型构装体」；(4) 末句 \"Your badassery must have interrupted this demon's writing\" 意为打断了恶魔的书写，被改成「把这个恶魔吓尿了」，语义变了。"}]}